# The built package and the packed connectome are release assets, not history.
#
# fly-doctrines.odmod is 32 MB and data/brain.odfly is 41 MB, and both are
# produced by build.sh from the FlyWire download. Committing them would put
# 73 MB in every clone for ever, and a second copy with every rebuild. They
# are attached to the GitHub release instead, which is also where the mod
# directory's downloadUrl points.
fly-doctrines.odmod
data/brain.odfly
mod.wasm
